Data source attribution
-----------------------
The underlying records are public data published by the City of Chicago on its Data
Portal (https://data.cityofchicago.org/d/22u3-xenr) under the Portal's terms of use, and,
for the files in data/extras/, by the Cook County Assessor's Office on the Cook County
Open Data portal (datasets 3723-97qp, pabr-t5kh, wvhk-k5uv). Neither the City of Chicago
nor Cook County is affiliated with this repository or endorses it. Their own terms of use
continue to apply to the underlying records.

